      "updated": 1785692411730,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NOTE: Segments are travel independently over the network so reach to\ndestination may differ from order while sent.\nbcz sengments hop le le kar jaate hai to ho skta hai last wale segments\nkam(low) hop lekar pehle pohch jaaye and starting k segments jyada hope\nle ke baad me pahuche",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NOTE: Segments are travel independently over the network so reach to destination may differ from order while sent.\nbcz sengments hop le le kar jaate hai to ho skta hai last wale segments kam(low) hop lekar pehle pohch jaaye and starting k segments jyada hope le ke baad me pahuche",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
