      "index": "cJnV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1988551186,
      "version": 364,
      "versionNonce": 1858171214,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "OjGOGhnOxcbeJQXujIgnX",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1785694621512,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MTU (Maximum Transmission Unit)\n- Largest IP packet a link can carry without fragmentation\n- MTU includes IP header + TCP/UDP header + payload\n- Ethernet header is not part of MTU (IMPORTANT)\n- Ethernet MTU is typically 1500 bytes\n- Different links can have different MTUs\n- Exceeding MTU can cause fragmentation or packet drops",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MTU (Maximum Transmission Unit)\n- Largest IP packet a link can carry without fragmentation\n- MTU includes IP header + TCP/UDP header + payload\n- Ethernet header is not part of MTU (IMPORTANT)\n- Ethernet MTU is typically 1500 bytes\n- Different links can have different MTUs\n- Exceeding MTU can cause fragmentation or packet drops",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
